---
layout: base
title: Infrastructure, automation and things I build
description: Technical articles on infrastructure, automation and things I build.
tags: page
---
<header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Field journal</p><h1>Posts</h1><p>Notes on infrastructure, automation and things I build.</p></header>
<div class="entry-list">
{% for post in collections.post | newestFirst %}
  <section class="entry">
    <p class="meta"><time datetime="{{ post.data.publish_date | publishedISO }}">{{ post.data.publish_date }}</time></p>
    <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
    <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    {% if post.data.tags %}<p class="tags">{% for tag in post.data.tags %}{% if tag != 'post' %}<span>#{{ tag }}</span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>{% endif %}
  </section>
{% endfor %}
</div>
